/-- **Theorem `KKT₆` (Odd-to-Extremal Bracket Closure `[g_{+1}, g_{+1}] ⊆ g_{+2}`)**:
`[G_{+1}^L(N_+, X), G_{+1}^R(N_+, Y)] = G_{+2}(N_+, X (1 - Gap) Y)`. -/
theorem comm_G_plus1_into_G_plus2 (N_plus X Y : B)
    (h_nil : N_plus * N_plus = 0)
